          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="hp__stroke hp__stroke--2"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path><path d="M12 7v5l4 2"></path></svg>
          Activity
